26-2:
Learning rate change:
Epochs 1-3 (Warmup):
LR: 0.0001 → 0.001 (gradual increase) - Helps stabilize early training
Epochs 4-30 (Cosine Decay):
LR: 0.001 → 0.00001 (smooth decay)
Formula: LR = min_lr + 0.5 * (max_lr - min_lr) * (1 + cos(π * epoch / total))

