31/5
infer.py (circle model):

Added circle_nms() using get_circle_iou_scalar — O(N²) greedy NMS on true circle IoU
infer(): branches on use_circles — circle path uses convert_yolo_pred_circles + circle_nms, box path is unchanged
evaluate_map(): replaces the bounding-square proxy + dedup + torchvision NMS with a single circle_nms call
plot_pr_curves.py:

Added _circle_nms() using the existing _circle_iou helper
eval_circle_model(): replaces the same dedup + box NMS block with _circle_nms
Both pipelines are now symmetric: circle model uses circle IoU everywhere (training loss, evaluation matching, and NMS), baseline uses box IoU everywhere. No extra post-processing steps.

