===========================
STRUCTURE OF Yolov1-PyTorch
===========================
config
--- __init__.py
--- voc.yaml (configuration)
data
--- test
------ xxx_Untrimmed_Frame_x_xxx_rgb.json
------ xxx_Untrimmed_Frame_x_xxx_rgb.png
--- train
------ xxx_Untrimmed_Frame_x_xxx_rgb.json
------ xxx_Untrimmed_Frame_x_xxx_rgb.png
--- val
------ xxx_Untrimmed_Frame_x_xxx_rgb.json
------ xxx_Untrimmed_Frame_x_xxx_rgb.png
dataset
--- __init__.py
--- voc.py (def load_images_and_anns, dataloader & class VOCDataset, data transformer)
loss
--- __init__.py
--- yolov1_loss.py (def get_iou, to calculate iou & class YOLOV1Loss, to calculate loss)
models
--- __init__.py
--- yolo.py (class YOLOV1, actual model)
tools
--- __init__.py
--- infer.py (?)
--- train.py (def collate_function, to arrange data & def train, trains the model)
utils
--- __init__.py
--- visualization_utils.py (def visualize_bbox & def visualize & def draw_grid & def draw_cls_grid & def draw_cls_text)
